                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/5293: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Munro</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-20T12:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                                1928—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 3:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>37. The substitute electoral law was sent to the Senate this morning; it will be
                    considered Tuesday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Munro</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
